{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","赛特斯"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名灵活的刺客，擅长偷袭虚弱的目标。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要猎杀的，是谁？"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Who's my next prey?"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","更加锋利了，我的武器——以及我自己。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Be ever sharper—my weapon, and myself."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","喝啊——（配合咆哮，可以不写进台词）就是你了！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Rargh! You're it!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","以牙还牙……呵呵，不错"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","An eye for an eye... hah... not bad."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","胜利就是胜利，无论使用什么手段。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Victory is victory, no matter how it's attained."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","阴影中的利爪，向您问候"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","谁？是你呀，下次别站在我背后。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","哼，走着瞧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","丟掉吧。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_i18n/cn","什么事也让我久等。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","竟然猜中了我的喜好……"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","嗯……谢了。"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有没有更暗的地方？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","休息到晚上吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","番茄汁？！好吧，算了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","雪和灯光有点刺眼"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","一个节日而已……算了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有些过于热闹了……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","到处都是灯，太亮了"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯出身沙漠，可以数日不喝水不吃饭。但如果有饮食的机会，他也会吃到呕吐的前一秒为止。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯自视甚高，在他还年幼时，他就永远只吃没被碰过的猎物。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯由于狂妄的性格，在自己的出身地没什么亲朋。但他不在乎那些蝼蚁怎么想。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯由于黑色的表皮，体温比一般人更热。这也有助于他在夜晚保持体温。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯的舌头上有倒刺，这能帮助他更好地舔干敌人的骨头。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯偶尔会在半夜看着星空，没有人知道他到底在想什么。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯自信速度无人能及。在沙漠中，没有任何载具可以媲美他的速度。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯冷血无情，即使亲族在面前被害也能做到面不改色。因为这在残酷的沙漠中是每一秒都在发生的事情。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯可以用后腿挠到头顶，不过他注意让自己不要那么做。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","赛特斯杀人如麻，从出生至今杀了多少人，他已经不记得了。就像人不会记得自己曾吃过多少面包。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","狩猎根本没什么技巧而言，对于猎手来说，只是驱动本能行事。"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411090.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/0/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","其实我不太喜欢这样安静的环境。"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411180.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/1/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","荒角沙漠"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","有没有更暗的地方？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415092.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","番茄汁？！好吧，算了……"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415093.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","雪和灯光有点刺眼"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415401.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","一个节日而已……算了"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415402.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","有些过于热闹了……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415573.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","到处都是灯，太亮了"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415574.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","赛特斯"]]}